[node name="ChangesRTLabel" type="RichTextLabel" parent="MainCenter/MainPanel/MainContainer/InfoContainer" unique_id=846968666]
layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 3
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "[font_size=20][b][color=SKY_BLUE]New[/color][/b][/font_size]
[ul] Slimmed down the binary by more than half its size.
 You can now use ctrl+z and ctrl+y/ctrl+shift+z to undo or redo while on the tag list (as long as you're not on a text field).
 Project images can now also be GIF images.
 Alternate version lists are now able to have their own image and suggestions.
 Added \"Monochrome\" to the Wizard.
 The wizard ball will now also visually update when selecting sketch/line art.
 You can now save/overwrite characters within the tag wizard.
 Added the ability to edit a website info after creation by double-clicking it.
 Added a checkbox when creating websites to toggle whether to use the prefixes or not.
 When formatting a tag using a website with prefixes it'll now use them.[/ul]
[font_size=20][b][color=SKY_BLUE]Fixes[/color][/b][/font_size]
[ul] Fixed an issue where advancing on the tag wizard and then returning to characters the character tag would no longer update.
 Fixed an issue where the tag wizard was not adding all the selected character poses.[/ul]"
